{"text": "Venkataraman & Holt CPAs, PLLC\n\n9800 Research Boulevard, Bldg. 2, Suite 310, Austin, TX 78759-6418\n\nBilling questions: 512-555-0166 or billing@vhcpas.example\n\nStatement of account\n\nField\tDetail\n\nClient\tPAPADAKIS-LOWE, GEORGIA and LOWE, NIKOLAI\n\nClient no.\t20418-J\n\nStatement date\tOctober 1, 2026\n\nBilling address\t3307 Bee Caves Trail, West Lake Hills, TX 78746\n\nPortal login\tgpapadakislowe\n\nTerms\tNet 30\n\nActivity\n\nDate\tInvoice\tDescription\tCharges\tPayments\n\n07/15/2026\tINV-26-3391\tForm 1040 preparation, tax year 2025 (extended), incl. Schedule E for the Port Aransas rental\t$1,850.00\n\n07/15/2026\tINV-26-3392\tForm 1120-S, Papadakis-Lowe Family Dentistry, P.L.L.C.\t$2,400.00\n\n08/02/2026\t\tPayment -- Visa ending 5148\t\t$2,000.00\n\n08/28/2026\tINV-26-3718\tIRS notice response; Form 2848 for Nikolai\t$675.00\n\n09/12/2026\t\tPayment -- ACH from account ending x7702\t\t$1,250.00\n\n09/30/2026\t\tLate fee on INV-26-3392\t$36.00\n\nBalance due: $1,711.00\n\nPayment method on file\n\nVisa, cardholder Georgia Papadakis-Lowe, number 4754 4783 9339 5148, expires 09/28. Autopay is off. To pay online go to https://pay.vhcpas.example/c/20418-J.\n\nNotes from your accountant\n\nGeorgia -- thank you for the September payment. Two things. First, the IRS letter for Nikolai (notice CP2000 dated August 10, 2026) proposes additional tax of $4,318 because the brokerage reported the sale of his late mother's stock without basis. We answered on September 4; expect ten to twelve weeks. Second, the practice's EIN on the state franchise filing was keyed as 74-2981135; the correct number is 74-2981153. We have corrected it at no charge.\n\nIf the balance is a hardship while Nikolai is out on medical leave, call me on my direct line, (512) 555-0109, and we will set up a plan.\n\nArjun Venkataraman, CPA\n\narjun@vhcpas.example", "kind": "Web page", "detail": "259 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Venkataraman", "Georgia Papadakis-Lowe", "Nikolai Papadakis"], "companies": ["Venkataraman & Holt CPAs, PLLC", "Papadakis-Lowe Family Dentistry, P.L.L.C.", "vhcpas.example"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.6999999992549419, "modelMs": 15272.699999999255, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "passport_dl", "routing", "phone", "record", "vin", "account", "money", "dob", "age90", "date", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 30, "text": "Venkataraman & Holt CPAs, PLLC", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Venkataraman & Holt CPAs, PLLC"}, {"start": 32, "end": 55, "text": "9800 Research Boulevard", "kind": "street", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "9800 Research Boulevard"}, {"start": 88, "end": 98, "text": "78759-6418", "kind": "account", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "78759-6418"}, {"start": 119, "end": 131, "text": "512-555-0166", "kind": "phone", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "512-555-0166"}, {"start": 135, "end": 157, "text": "billing@vhcpas.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "billing@vhcpas.example"}, {"start": 280, "end": 295, "text": "October 1, 2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "October 1, 2026"}, {"start": 355, "end": 360, "text": "78746", "kind": "zip", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "78746"}, {"start": 458, "end": 468, "text": "07/15/2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "07/15/2026"}, {"start": 575, "end": 584, "text": "$1,850.00", "kind": "money", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "$1,850.00"}, {"start": 586, "end": 596, "text": "07/15/2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "07/15/2026"}, {"start": 622, "end": 663, "text": "Papadakis-Lowe Family Dentistry, P.L.L.C.", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Papadakis-Lowe Family Dentistry, P.L.L.C."}, {"start": 664, "end": 673, "text": "$2,400.00", "kind": "money", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "$2,40